WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.310
Your AI assistant could be a real help with your taxes,

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:09.500
but you wouldn't paste your whole tax folder into it.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.625
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.240
Everything on this page is what your AI assistant can see too,

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.866
but only in masked form.

00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:24.015
It connects through M C P, the standard way to plug tools into an assistant.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.018
One command adds taxtrace to Claude Code.

00:00:30.018 --> 00:00:34.753
The assistant is offered five tools: status, the list of documents,

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:38.569
a document's outline, form checks, and the to-do list.

00:00:38.569 --> 00:00:40.195
Every one is read-only.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.293
What comes back is counts and masked text.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:46.330
The dates are real, but the wording is masked,

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.971
and no tool returns an amount or a name.

00:00:48.971 --> 00:00:53.395
A locked document is never opened, and the Keychain is never asked.
